  "The equations do not agree at a change (Pottel 2019: a mean jump of 23 mL/min/1.73 m² from CKiD to CKD-EPI at 18 years), so part of a slope fitted across it can come from the change of equation rather than from kidney function.",
  "The equations do not agree at a change (Pottel 2019: a mean jump of 23 mL/min/1.73 m² from CKiD to CKD-EPI at 18 years), so part of this slope can come from the change of equation rather than from kidney function.",
