  "The extrapolation to CKD G5 is switched on in {list}, as saved: a conditional extrapolation of the fitted trend, not a prognosis. It has been off by default since 2026-11-22 and can be switched off in the endpoint settings of the parameter.",
  "The first fit of a session loads R into the browser; this can take a few minutes. Later fits take seconds.",
